const tools=[{icon:'🥄',name:'spoon'},{icon:'🍴',name:'fork'},{icon:'🔪',name:'knife'},{icon:'🥣',name:'bowl'},{icon:'🧂',name:'salt shaker'},{icon:'🧽',name:'sponge'}];
const SIZE=8, GOAL=1200, START_MOVES=25;
let board=[], selected=-1, score=0, moves=START_MOVES, busy=false, combo=0;
const root=document.getElementById('app');
root.innerHTML=`<div class="site"><header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><div class="brandmark">✳</div><div>mix & match<br><span>kitchen club</span></div></div><div class="topright">Açúcar? Hoje não.</div></header><main class="layout"><section class="game-column"><div class="eyebrow">Desafio da bancada · 01</div><h1 class="heading">Organize a bagunça.</h1><p class="subtitle">Combine utensílios iguais e deixe a cozinha brilhando.</p><div class="scorebar"><div class="stat"><label>Pontuação</label><strong id="score">0</strong></div><div class="stat"><label>Objetivo</label><strong>${GOAL.toLocaleString('pt-BR')}</strong></div><div class="stat"><label>Jogadas</label><strong id="moves">${START_MOVES}</strong></div></div><div class="board-shell"><div class="board" id="board" role="grid" aria-label="Tabuleiro de utensílios"></div><div class="message hidden" id="message"><div class="message-card"><div class="emoji" id="resultEmoji">✨</div><h3 id="resultTitle">Mandou bem!</h3><p id="resultCopy"></p><button class="button" id="playAgain">Jogar de novo</button></div></div></div><div class="board-footer"><span>✦ Combos rendem pontos extras</span><span id="status">Sua vez de combinar</span></div></section><aside class="side"><div class="side-kicker">Uma pausa gostosa</div><h2>Doce jogo.<br><em>Zero doces.</em></h2><p class="copy">Talheres, tigelas e esponjas tomaram conta da bancada. Faça trincas para arrumar tudo — com um pouquinho de estratégia.</p><div class="goal-card"><div class="goal-top"><span>Meta da rodada</span><strong>⭐ <span id="goalScore">0</span> / ${GOAL.toLocaleString('pt-BR')}</strong></div><div class="progress"><i id="progress"></i></div><div class="goal-note">Dica: sequências maiores valem mais pontos.</div></div><button class="button" id="newGame">↻ &nbsp; Nova rodada</button><div class="hint"><b>↔</b><span>Toque em dois utensílios vizinhos para trocar. Forme uma linha de 3 ou mais iguais!</span></div></aside></main><footer class="footer"><span>FEITO PARA UMA COZINHA MAIS DIVERTIDA</span><span><b>mix & match</b> · edição utensílios</span></footer></div>`;
const boardEl=document.getElementById('board');
const rand=()=>Math.floor(Math.random()*tools.length);
function newBoard(){board=Array.from({length:SIZE*SIZE},(_,i)=>{let v;do{v=rand()}while((i%SIZE>1&&board[i-1]===v&&board[i-2]===v)||(i>=2*SIZE&&board[i-SIZE]===v&&board[i-2*SIZE]===v));return v;});score=0;moves=START_MOVES;selected=-1;combo=0;update();}
function update(){document.getElementById('score').textContent=score.toLocaleString('pt-BR');document.getElementById('goalScore').textContent=score.toLocaleString('pt-BR');document.getElementById('moves').textContent=moves;document.getElementById('progress').style.width=Math.min(100,score/GOAL*100)+'%';render();}
function render(){boardEl.innerHTML='';board.forEach((v,i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='tile'+(i===selected?' selected':'');b.type='button';b.setAttribute('role','gridcell');b.setAttribute('aria-label',`${tools[v].name}, linha ${Math.floor(i/SIZE)+1}, coluna ${i%SIZE+1}`);b.textContent=tools[v].icon;b.dataset.index=i;b.addEventListener('click',()=>choose(i));boardEl.appendChild(b);});}
function choose(i){if(busy)return;if(selected<0){selected=i;render();return;}if(i===selected){selected=-1;render();return;}const near=Math.abs(i-selected)===SIZE||(Math.floor(i/SIZE)===Math.floor(selected/SIZE)&&Math.abs(i-selected)===1);if(!near){selected=i;render();return;}const a=selected,b=i;selected=-1;[board[a],board[b]]=[board[b],board[a]];const found=findMatches();if(!found.length){[board[a],board[b]]=[board[b],board[a]];render();document.getElementById('status').textContent='Essa troca não forma uma trinca';setTimeout(()=>{if(!busy)document.getElementById('status').textContent='Sua vez de combinar';},1200);return;}moves--;combo=0;resolve(found);}
function findMatches(){const set=new Set();for(let r=0;r<SIZE;r++){let c=0;while(c<SIZE){let e=c+1;while(e<SIZE&&board[r*SIZE+e]===board[r*SIZE+c])e++;if(e-c>=3)for(let k=c;k<e;k++)set.add(r*SIZE+k);c=e;}}for(let c=0;c<SIZE;c++){let r=0;while(r<SIZE){let e=r+1;while(e<SIZE&&board[e*SIZE+c]===board[r*SIZE+c])e++;if(e-r>=3)for(let k=r;k<e;k++)set.add(k*SIZE+c);r=e;}}return [...set];}
function resolve(matches){if(!matches.length){busy=false;update();checkEnd();return;}busy=true;combo++;document.getElementById('status').textContent=combo>1?`Combo x${combo}!`:'Boa combinação!';matches.forEach(i=>{const el=boardEl.children[i];if(el)el.classList.add('matched');});score+=matches.length*60+(combo-1)*100;setTimeout(()=>{matches.forEach(i=>board[i]=-1);for(let c=0;c<SIZE;c++){let write=SIZE-1;for(let r=SIZE-1;r>=0;r--){const i=r*SIZE+c;if(board[i]!==-1){board[write*SIZE+c]=board[i];write--;}}while(write>=0)board[write--*SIZE+c]=rand();}render();setTimeout(()=>resolve(findMatches()),160);},240);}
function checkEnd(){if(score>=GOAL){endGame(true);}else if(moves<=0){endGame(false);}else{document.getElementById('status').textContent='Sua vez de combinar';}}
function endGame(win){document.getElementById('resultEmoji').textContent=win?'🏆':'🧺';document.getElementById('resultTitle').textContent=win?'Bancada brilhando!':'Rodada encerrada';document.getElementById('resultCopy').textContent=win?`Você fez ${score.toLocaleString('pt-BR')} pontos e deixou tudo em ordem. Que talento!`:`Você marcou ${score.toLocaleString('pt-BR')} pontos. Mais uma rodada e essa cozinha fica impecável!`;document.getElementById('message').classList.remove('hidden');}
document.getElementById('newGame').addEventListener('click',()=>{document.getElementById('message').classList.add('hidden');newBoard();});document.getElementById('playAgain').addEventListener('click',()=>{document.getElementById('message').classList.add('hidden');newBoard();});newBoard();

